{"path":"/tip/13-29","title":"被蛇咬，坐下别动、摘掉戒指手表、尽快送医院打抗蛇毒血清，不切、不吸、不绑死 | HowToLiveBetter","description":"坐下别动，把被咬的肢体固定住，先摘掉戒指手表，免得肿起来勒住。尽快送到有抗蛇毒血清的医院，血清是防止或逆转大部分毒性最有效的办法。不切开，不用嘴吸，不冰敷，不揉，不用绳子勒，也别走动。能拍张蛇的照片就拍，别去抓。","lang":"zh","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter 首页","href":"/"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["阅读全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["精选 50 条"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每日任务"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["我的清单"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["更多"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-tools"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-sound-toggle","aria-label":"关闭音效","aria-pressed":"true","title":"关闭音效"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-theme-trigger","aria-label":"跟随系统","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-sun life-theme-icon-light","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 20v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"中文 选择语言","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["中文"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["登录同步"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/book/13"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"返回目录"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["紧急情况：先做什么"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"章节条目"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-01","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"有人倒地没呼吸，立刻用力按压胸口，让旁人打 120 并找 AED"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-02","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"老人摔倒、有人倒地，先蹲下喊他、打 120，别急着把人扶起来；陌生人这档走开在国内也合法，停下来就别上手搬"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-03","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"突然嘴歪、一侧胳膊没劲、说话说不清，立刻打 120，不要等、不要自己开车去"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-04","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"突然天旋地转站不稳、看东西成双、一只眼发黑，或者手指点不到自己鼻尖，也按卒中打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-05","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"一只眼睛突然像拉下窗帘一样黑掉，哪怕几分钟就自己好了，也当天按卒中去急诊"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-06","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"一只眼又胀又痛、发红，看灯有一圈彩虹，还头痛恶心想吐，当天去眼科急诊"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-07","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"胸口压着疼、闷、发紧超过 15 分钟不缓解，或者疼时出冷汗、恶心、喘不上气，打 120，不要自己扛也不要自己开车"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-08","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"突然像被撕开一样的剧痛，从胸口往后背、往腰一路挪，打 120 并说清「像撕开一样」"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-09","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"突然一记「这辈子最疼的头痛」，一小时内就到最疼，立刻去急诊做头颅 CT"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-10","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"老人磕过头之后两三周到几个月变得走路不稳、迟钝、嗜睡或者一侧没劲，去做头颅 CT"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-11","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"一条腿突然肿起来、发紧、按着疼，尽快就医；再加上突然喘不上气或者胸痛，立刻打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-12","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"大出血先用手死死压住伤口，四肢压不住就上止血带，同时打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-13","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"被狗、猫咬伤或抓破皮，先用肥皂水和流水交替冲 15 分钟，当天去打疫苗"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-14","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"烫伤后立刻用凉的流动水冲 20 分钟，别抹牙膏酱油"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-15","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"突然全身起疹、喘不上气或者发晕，按过敏性休克处理，立刻叫 120 并说清楚"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-16","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"有人抽搐倒地，清开周围、让他侧躺、看表计时，什么都别往嘴里塞；孩子发烧时抽搐也一样"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-17","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"糖尿病人突然发抖、出冷汗、说话不清，先给 15 克糖，15 分钟后复测"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-18","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"有人触电，先断电，再用干燥的木棍之类挑开电源，不要直接上手拉"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-19","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"一氧化碳报警器响了，或者一屋子人同时头痛恶心，先出门再打电话"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-20","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"误服清洁剂、农药、药物先别催吐，带上瓶子立刻就医；溅到眼睛或皮肤用大量清水至少冲 15 分钟"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-21","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"酸碱等化学品溅到身上，立刻脱掉污染的衣服、用大量流动清水冲，眼睛要掰开眼皮冲，冲够时间再走"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-22","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"高温下头晕、恶心、不出汗或意识不清，立刻挪到阴凉处脱衣泼水降温，意识不清的不喂水、打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-23","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"中暑的人只要清醒，就少量多次喝凉的淡盐水或运动饮料，别猛灌、别喝酒和高糖饮料"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-24","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"火灾时贴地爬、摸门再开门、门烫就别开，走楼梯不坐电梯，出去了别回头"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-25","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"看到有人溺水，先叫人和打 110/120，伸竿、抛漂浮物，自己不下水"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-26","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"有人噎住说不出话，1 岁以上的站到背后做 5 次拍背加 5 次腹部冲击，倒下就做心肺复苏"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-27","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"在戈壁、沙漠、无人区迷路或车坏了，留在原地或车旁，先报位置，再遮阳保温，省水，不乱走"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-28","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"发抖、说话含糊、走路打晃是失温，换掉湿衣、包起来，先暖躯干，喝热甜饮不喝酒"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-29","className":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"被蛇咬，坐下别动、摘掉戒指手表、尽快送医院打抗蛇毒血清，不切、不吸、不绑死"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-30","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"地震时先看自己在什么房子里：符合抗震设防的楼里就地躲，会垮的老房子门在几步外就出去"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-31","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"遇到熊、野猪、成群野狗，别跑，侧身慢慢退开"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-32","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"野外遇上雷雨，钻进有硬顶的车或建筑，避开山脊、孤树、水面和金属"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-33","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"上高原按睡眠海拔（当晚睡在多高）慢慢升，症状加重就下撤，不要硬扛"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-34","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"被蜱虫叮住，用尖头镊子贴着皮肤稳稳拉出来，别涂油别用火烧"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-35","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"野外的水一律烧开再喝，滚开一分钟就够，常见的旅行海拔上不用因为海拔高多煮"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-36","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"荒郊野外被陌生人索财，钱给他，不动手，记特征，脱身后报警"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-37","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"撞见一群人打架，退开走人，别上去拉架、别围观、别捡地上的家伙；要报警就退到安全距离打 110"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-38","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"可能被 HIV 暴露了，72 小时内去拿阻断药，越早越好"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-39","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"救人受了伤、搭进了钱，先找加害人和医保，再去申报见义勇为确认"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-40","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"刀、钢筋、玻璃扎进身体，压住异物周围止血，不要把它拔出来"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-41","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"怀疑骨折就别再动那个部位，托着不动、冷敷 20 分钟以内，别自己掰正"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-42","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"被性侵之后，先到安全的地方打 110；验伤之前别洗澡、别洗衣服、别收拾房间，72 小时内去医院"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-43","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"不满 1 岁的婴儿噎住哭不出声，趴着拍背 5 下、翻过来按胸口 5 下，轮着做，别按肚子"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-44","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"不满 1 岁的婴儿没反应、没正常呼吸，开免提打 120，做婴儿心肺复苏：按 30 下吹 2 口气"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-45","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["45"]},"孩子吞了纽扣电池，或者吞了两颗以上的强磁珠，立刻去有胃镜的医院急诊，别等它自己拉出来、别催吐"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-46","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["46"]},"有人喝醉了，让他侧躺、有人一直守着，别让他一个人睡；叫不醒、呼吸慢或不规律、抽搐、身上发凉就打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-47","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["47"]},"手指、脚趾被切断，先压住伤口止血，断下来的部分用湿纱布包好装进密封袋，袋子放进冰水里，去有手外科的医院"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-48","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["48"]},"恒牙（换牙之后长出来的牙）整颗撞掉，捏住牙冠冲一下，能放回去就放回去，放不回就泡在牛奶里，马上去看牙；乳牙别放回去"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/13"},"children":["第 13 章 · 紧急情况：先做什么"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"13-29"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["29"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["证据 B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["被蛇咬，坐下别动、摘掉戒指手表、尽快送医院打抗蛇毒血清，不切、不吸、不绑死"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["坐下别动，把被咬的肢体固定住，先摘掉戒指手表，免得肿起来勒住。尽快送到有抗蛇毒血清的医院，血清是防止或逆转大部分毒性最有效的办法。不切开，不用嘴吸，不冰敷，不揉，不用绳子勒，也别走动。能拍张蛇的照片就拍，别去抓。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。提前知道附近哪家医院有抗蛇毒血清。难的是忍住自己动手处理伤口。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["WHO 原文有三句。一句是「立即完全固定被咬的身体部位，并迅速送到最近的医疗机构就医」。一句是「避免使用止血带，并避免切割伤口」。还有一句是「用针对当地蛇种的适当抗蛇毒血清进行治疗」。「高质量抗蛇毒血清是防止或逆转蛇咬伤的大部分毒性作用的最有效治疗方法」。全球每年约 8.1 万到 13.8 万人死于…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：被蛇咬，坐下别动、摘掉戒指手表、尽快送医院打抗蛇毒血清，不切、不吸、不绑死"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。提前知道附近哪家医院有抗蛇毒血清。难的是忍住自己动手处理伤口。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["WHO 原文有三句。一句是「立即完全固定被咬的身体部位，并迅速送到最近的医疗机构就医」。一句是「避免使用止血带，并避免切割伤口」。还有一句是「用针对当地蛇种的适当抗蛇毒血清进行治疗」。「高质量抗蛇毒血清是防止或逆转蛇咬伤的大部分毒性作用的最有效治疗方法」。全球每年约 8.1 万到 13.8 万人死于蛇咬伤，截肢和永久残疾的人数约为死亡数的 3 倍。中国 2024 年的蛇伤救治指南估计，国内每年有 25 万到 28 万例毒蛇咬伤。被咬的多是 50 岁以上的人。长江流域和南方 11 个省的医院，2017 到 2021 年收治了 40817 名蛇伤病人。住院期间死亡 23 人（0.06%）。国际红十字 2025 年急救指南写明：被咬的人尽量少动，咬在腿上就别走路。摘掉首饰、手表和紧身衣物，免得肿起来勒住血流。不要用止血带、不要吸、不要冷敷、不要揉、不要用刀割开，这些做法没用，还可能更伤。能安全拍到蛇的照片就拍，不要去抓或打死它"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["WHO. 动物咬伤 实况报道. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/animal-bites","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/animal-bites"]}," ; WHO (2023). 蛇咬伤中毒 实况报道. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/snakebite-envenoming","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/snakebite-envenoming"]}," ; Lai R 等 (2024). The Chinese guideline for management of snakebites. World Journal of Emergency Medicine 15(5):333-355：「An estimated 250,000–280,000 cases of venomous snakebites occur in China each year, affecting mainly patients aged ≥50 years」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.5847/wjem.j.1920-8642.2024.076","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.5847/wjem.j.1920-8642.2024.076"]}," ; Yan S 等 (2026). Clinical epidemiology of snakebite envenoming in hospitals 11 provinces of Yangtze River Basin and southern regions of China. PLoS Neglected Tropical Diseases：「withdrawal (4346, 10.65%), and death (23, 0.06%)」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pntd.0013247","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pntd.0013247"]}," ; International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies (2025). International First Aid, Resuscitation and Education Guidelines 2025，第 339–341 页：「Remove jewellery, watches or tight clothing to prevent blood flow being restricted if there is swelling」「The following actions are not effective and may even cause further harm: applying a tourniquet, sucking out the venom, applying a cold compress, rubbing the bite, cutting the wound with a knife to increase bleeding」「Do not try to catch or kill the snake. Consider taking a photo」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ifrc.org/sites/default/files/2026-03/IFRC%20International%20First%20Aid,%20Resuscitation%20and%20Education%20Guidelines%202025.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ifrc.org/sites/default/files/2026-03/IFRC%20International%20First%20Aid,%20Resuscitation%20and%20Education%20Guidelines%202025.pdf"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["能拍到蛇的照片就拍，别去抓。不要跑动，不要用嘴吸，不要冰敷，不要用绳子勒。中国的全国蛇伤死亡数没有官方统计。那 11 个省的住院死亡率看着低，但有一成多病人没治完就自己出院了，他们后来怎样不在统计里。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/13-28"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"发抖、说话含糊、走路打晃是失温，换掉湿衣、包起来，先暖躯干，喝热甜饮不喝酒"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/13-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"地震时先看自己在什么房子里：符合抗震设防的楼里就地躲，会垮的老房子门在几步外就出去"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-25"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["看到有人溺水，先叫人和打 110/120，伸竿、抛漂浮物，自己不下水"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["碰到正在挣扎的溺水者，施救的人可能被拖下水淹死。顺序是：大喊叫人 → 打 110/120 → 递长杆、绳子 → 抛救生圈、空桶、矿泉水瓶 → 人上岸没呼吸就立刻…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-26"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["有人噎住说不出话，1 岁以上的站到背后做 5 次拍背加 5 次腹部冲击，倒下就做心肺复苏"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["先问「你噎住了吗，能说话吗」，还能咳、能出声的让他自己咳。1 岁以上的说不出话，就站到背后，5 次拍背接 5 次腹部冲击，孕妇和很胖的人改冲胸口。反复做到东西出…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-27"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["在戈壁、沙漠、无人区迷路或车坏了，留在原地或车旁，先报位置，再遮阳保温，省水，不乱走"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["留在原地或者车旁，车是最大的遮阳物。顺序是：有信号先发位置再打电话 → 遮阳保暖 → 省水 → 不乱走 → 用反光镜、烟、三堆火发信号。白天不动，夜里凉了再动。…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-31"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["遇到熊、野猪、成群野狗，别跑，侧身慢慢退开"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["遇到熊别跑，它上下坡都跑得像赛马，也别爬树，黑熊棕熊都会爬。站住，低声一直跟它说话，等它不动了再侧身慢慢退开。棕熊扑上来就趴下装死、双手扣住后颈，黑熊扑上来就往…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-32"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["野外遇上雷雨，钻进有硬顶的车或建筑，避开山脊、孤树、水面和金属"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["雷暴范围内的户外没有安全的地方。钻进硬顶的车或者建筑，敞篷车、摩托、帐篷、凉亭、树下、突出的岩石下面都不算。避开开阔地、山脊山顶、孤立的大树、水面和铁栏杆，一群…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-33"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["上高原按睡眠海拔（当晚睡在多高）慢慢升，症状加重就下撤，不要硬扛"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["算的是睡在多高，不是白天到过多高，睡在 2450 米以上就有高原病风险。过了 3000 米之后，每晚睡觉的高度只往上加 500 米，每升 1000 米多留一天适…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/13"},"children":["阅读整个主题：紧急情况：先做什么 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.5